s-key:\nactive\\), the controller's key secrets informer (\\watchKeySecrets\\)\npreviously only had an \\AddFunc\\ handler.\n\nThis meant:\n1. Updated or newly labeled secrets were not detected without a pod\nrestart.\n2. Deleted key secrets were not unregistered from \\KeyRegistry\\.\n3. \\HasSynced\\ did not account for \\kInformer.HasSynced()\\.\n4. \\ egistryNewKeyWithSecret\\ logged errors on failed key reads but did\nnot return immediately, leading to potential slice indexing panics on\nempty cert slices.\n\n### Changes\n- Added \\UpdateFunc\\ and \\DeleteFunc\\ event handlers to\n\\watchKeySecrets\\ to dynamically register, update, and unregister keys.\n- Added \\unregisterKey\\ to \\KeyRegistry\\ which safely deletes keys by\nfingerprint and recomputes \\mostRecentKey\\.\n- Updated \\Controller.HasSynced\\ to check \\c.kInformer.HasSynced()\\ when\n\\kInformer\\ is present.\n- Added immediate error return in \\ egistryNewKeyWithSecret\\ on read\nfailures.\n- Added comprehensive unit tests in \\pkg/controller/controller_test.go\\\nand \\pkg/controller/keyregistry_test.go\\.\n\n### Checklist\n- [x] Signed-off with Developer Certificate of Origin (DCO)\n- [x] Unit tests added and passing\n\nSigned-off-by: Vedant Madane <6527493+VedantMadane@users.noreply.github.com>", "timestamp": "2026-09-16T08:09:43Z", "author": {"name": "Vedant Madane", "email": "6527493+VedantMadane@users.noreply.github.com"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com"}}, "repository": {"id": 92702519, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk5MjcwMjUxOQ==", "name": "sealed-secrets", "full_name": "bitnami/sealed-secrets", "private": false, "owner": {"login": "bitnami", "id": 5446553, "node_id": "MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjU0NDY1NTM=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5446553?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bitnami", "html_url": "https://github.com/bitnami", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bitnami/followers", "following_u